.TH "\FBKDIFF3\FR" "1" "2019\-02\-22" "kdiff3 1.8" "KDiff3 User's Manual"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
.\" http://bugs.debian.org/507673
.\" http://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/groff/2009-02/msg00013.html
.\" ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * set default formatting
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" disable hyphenation
.nh
.\" disable justification (adjust text to left margin only)
.ad l
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * MAIN CONTENT STARTS HERE *
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.SH "نام (NAME)"
kdiff3 \- Tool for Comparison and Merge of Files and Folders
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBkdiff3\fR\ 'u
\fBkdiff3\fR [\fB\-u,\ \-\-ignore\fR] [\fB\-\-query\fR] [\fB\-\-html\fR] [\fB\-\-abort\fR] [\fB\-m,\ \-\-merge\fR] [\fB\-b,\ \-\-base\fR\ \fIfile\fR] [\fB\-o,\ \-\-output\fR\ \fIfile\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR\ \fIfile\fR] [\fB\-\-noauto\fR] [\fB\-\-auto\fR] [\fB\-\-L1\fR\ \fIalias1\fR] [\fB\-\-L2\fR\ \fIalias2\fR] [\fB\-\-L3\fR\ \fIalias3\fR] [\fB\-L,\ \-\-fname\fR\ \fIalias\fR] [\fB\-\-cs\fR\ \fIstring\fR] [\fB\-\-confighelp\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR\ \fIfile\fR] [\fB\fIFile1\fR\fR] [\fB\fIFile2\fR\fR] [\fB\fIFile3\fR\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
Compares two or three input files or folders\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\-u, \-\-ignore\fR
.RS 4
Ignored\&. (User defined\&.)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-query\fR
.RS 4
Ignored\&. (User defined\&.)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-html\fR
.RS 4
Ignored\&. (User defined\&.)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-abort\fR
.RS 4
Ignored\&. (User defined\&.)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-m, \-\-merge\fR
.RS 4
Merge the input\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-b, \-\-base\fR \fIfile\fR
.RS 4
Explicit base file\&. For compatibility with certain tools\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-o, \-\-output\fR \fIfile\fR
.RS 4
Output file\&. Implies \-m\&.
e\&.g\&.: \-o newfile\&.txt
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fIfile\fR
.RS 4
Output file, again\&. (For compatibility with certain tools\&.)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-auto\fR
.RS 4
No GUI if all conflicts are auto\-solvable\&. (Needs
\fB\-o\fR
\fIfile\fR)
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-noauto\fR
.RS 4
Ignore \-\-auto and always show GUI\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-L1\fR \fIalias1\fR
.RS 4
Visible name replacement for input file 1 (base)\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-L2\fR \fIalias2\fR
.RS 4
Visible name replacement for input file 2\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-L3\fR \fIalias3\fR
.RS 4
Visible name replacement for input file 3\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-L, \-\-fname\fR \fIalias\fR
.RS 4
Alternative visible name replacement\&. Supply this once for every input\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-cs\fR \fIstring\fR
.RS 4
Override a config setting\&. Use once for every setting\&.
e\&.g\&.:
\fB\-\-cs\fR
\fIAutoAdvance=1\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-confighelp\fR
.RS 4
Show list of config settings and current values\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fIfile\fR
.RS 4
Use a different config file\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\fIFile1\fR\fR
.RS 4
file1 to open (base, if not specified via \-\-\fBbase\fR)
.RE
.PP
\fB\fIFile2\fR\fR
.RS 4
file2 to open
.RE
.PP
\fB\fIFile3\fR\fR
.RS 4
file3 to open
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.RS 4
More detailed user documentation is available from \m[blue]\fBhelp:/kdiff3\fR\m[]
(either enter this URL into Konqueror, or run
\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB
\fR\fB\fIhelp:/kdiff3\fR\fR)\&.
.RE
.RS 4
kf6options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
qt6options(7)
.RE
